window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Control is an art form.</b></p> <p>One Nick Fairhaven thought he mastered long ago. But gambling is a cruel mistress, and he lost everything.</p> <p>A chance meeting gives him hope for redemption. Now, he's balanced on the knife's edge between the future he wants and the past he can't escape.</p> <p>Will he risk it all for the woman he loves? Or will his life be nothing but unfulfilled promises?</p>"; 
